{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "连凯文跟杏子都收工了  (Even Kaiwen and Xingzi Clocked Off)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still working alone at Xingtian, Bu Xiaogu gets a frantic call from her admirer claiming Xin Huimei's fan club has hit a disaster—only to arrive and discover he invented the emergency to pull her out of her post-breakup gloom. Listen to Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，你发个地址给我，我马上过去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，拜拜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么事啊，这么急啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你没事吧？这么着急把我骗过来，就为这个活动？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你天天约我，约我一礼拜了，我有你那么闲吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文跟杏子都收工了，你怎么知道的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "闲的你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "天色晚了，早点回去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事没事，你买了新车？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我真没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，你发个地址给我，我马上过去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, text me the address and I'll head right over!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，拜拜。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got it — bye.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么事啊，这么急啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened that was so urgent?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你没事吧？这么着急把我骗过来，就为这个活动？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you out of your mind — tricking me into rushing over here just for a fan event?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你天天约我，约我一礼拜了，我有你那么闲吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You've invited me out every single day for a week — do I look as idle as you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文跟杏子都收工了，你怎么知道的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How on earth did you know that even Kaiwen and Xingzi already clocked off?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "闲的你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really have way too much free time!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for cheering me up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "天色晚了，早点回去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's getting late — you should head back early and get some rest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事没事，你买了新车？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm fine — wait, you bought a new car?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我真没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really can get home fine on my own.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright then, I'll hop in.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
